OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FA pop-up campsite is being erected on
OL,8,Fa field on the outskirts of Bowness-on-
OL,9,FWindermere that has now attracted over
OL,10,F1,200 signatures on a petition against
OL,11,Fit.
OL,13,FThe owners of holiday let business
OL,14,FBordriggs Farm say the campsite,
OL,15,Fopening on Saturday 15 August, will
OL,16,Fboost Lake District bed spaces by 50
OL,17,Ftents during the height of the tourist
OL,18,Fseason.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FPop-up campsites like this are allowed
OL,8,Funder rules designed to stop the fly
OL,9,Fcamping the area saw after the
OL,10,Fpandemic.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FCarolyn Jenson, one of the owners of
OL,8,FBordriggs Farm, told ITV Border the
OL,9,Freason they want to do it: "Because
OL,10,Fthere really isn't anywhere where
OL,11,Ffamilies can camp locally, and I walk
OL,12,Fdown by the lake every morning and
OL,13,Fthere's fly campers everywhere, so we
OL,14,Fthought, let's do it so that we can
OL,15,Fkeep it clean - we'll have at least
OL,16,Ffour toilets - because at the moment
OL,17,Fit's just an empty field doing
OL,18,Fnothing."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FMs Jenson says her family have lived
OL,8,Fin the area for a long time and hope
OL,9,Fit will also help their friends also
OL,10,Fworking in hospitality: "It's only a
OL,11,Fshort walk into the village where
OL,12,Fthere's plenty of bars, restaurants,
OL,13,Fshops which will all benefit from
OL,14,Fpeople staying here.
OL,16,F"It's not going to make huge amounts
OL,17,Fof money, but any money we do make, we
OL,18,Fare going to donate some to the
OL,19,FWindermere Food Bank as well."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FShe continues: "We want to put
OL,8,Fsomething back into the community and
OL,9,Fwe will keep on top of the rubbish;
OL,10,Fthe behaviour. We are a local family
OL,11,Fso we don't want to ruin the area
OL,12,Fwe've been brought up in our whole
OL,13,Flives."
OL,15,FThe campsite does not need a planning
OL,16,Fapplication because of a law brought
OL,17,Fin after the pandemic in 2023,
OL,18,Fallowing up to 50 pitches for up to 60
OL,19,Fdays.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FBut this isn't a field on a farm. It's
OL,8,Fon the outskirts of Bowness, in the
OL,9,Fgrounds of a holiday let, surrounded
OL,10,Fby homes.
OL,12,FThe neighbours say that shouldn't be
OL,13,Fallowed without planning permission.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FLocal resident Sarah Wilson told ITV
OL,8,FBorder: "I was really surprised
OL,9,Fbecause two years ago, in this very
OL,10,Fsame field, there had been a planning
OL,11,Fapplication for a development of five
OL,12,Fhouses and that had to go through the
OL,13,Ffull scrutiny of ecological surveys,
OL,14,Fhighway surveys, drainage, sewage."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FShe says she started the petition
OL,8,Fbecause she felt a National Park
OL,9,Fshould have the protection of planning
OL,10,Flaws for everything: "Being in the new
OL,11,Fconservation area and being in a
OL,12,Fnational park and being in the Unesco
OL,13,FWorld Heritage site, I was just really
OL,14,Fsurprised that something could appear
OL,15,Fon the same field without also
OL,16,Fchecking, you know, whether you can
OL,17,Fleave the site safely without a car
OL,18,Fcrashing into you."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FMs Wilson and her neighbours say they
OL,8,Fare not against pop up campsites, but
OL,9,Fthey do want them to go through the
OL,10,Fsame checks.
OL,12,FThey say The Lake District National
OL,13,FPark Authority has told them they have
OL,14,Freceived 47 applications like this in
OL,15,Fthe national park this year.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G9/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FSarah continues, "I would love for
OL,8,Fsomeone to apply for a campsite here.
OL,9,FAnd if it passes all the approval of
OL,10,Fthe planning department, that's
OL,11,Fabsolutely fine, because that's what
OL,12,Four laws are there for."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G10/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FHer neighbour, David Hardy, whose
OL,8,Fhouse is next to the field in
OL,9,Fquestion, told ITV Border: "The
OL,10,Flegislation behind this, I think, was
OL,11,Fvery laudable: an attempt to help
OL,12,Frural communities and farmers
OL,13,Fdiversify quickly after the Covid
OL,14,Fpandemic, but I think that's now
OL,15,Fserved its time."
OL,17,FFriends of the Lake District never
OL,18,Fthought it was right here in Cumbria,
OL,19,Fand now visitor numbers seem to be
OL,20,Frising again, the charity say it needs
OL,21,Fchanging.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G11/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FToday they're asking for the public's
OL,8,Fviews, launching a public consultation.
OL,10,FHead of Planning and Policy for
OL,11,FFriends of the Lake District, Lorayne
OL,12,FWall, told ITV Border: "We did have a
OL,13,Flot of people get in touch with us -
OL,14,Fmembers of the public; parish councils
OL,15,F- expressing concerns about some of
OL,16,Fthe pop-up campsites that were
OL,17,Fhappening at that stage.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G12/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,F"And it's been similar recently,
OL,8,Fparticularly over the summer months.
OL,9,FOf course, that's when most of these
OL,10,Fpop-up campsites tend to operate."
OL,12,FThe National Park Authority can revoke
OL,13,Fpermission if it's necessary to
OL,14,Fprotect the area, in what is called an
OL,15,FArticle 4 Direction. It says it's
OL,16,Fconsidering it, but compensation must
OL,17,Falso be paid.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G13/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FAndrew Smith, Head of Development
OL,8,FManagement at Lake District National
OL,9,FPark Authority, said: "We are aware of
OL,10,Fconcerns about several temporary
OL,11,Fcampsites across the National Park. We
OL,12,Fhave also received multiple requests
OL,13,Ffor an Article 4 Direction to be
OL,14,Fserved. We will be considering this
OL,15,Fissue further over the coming months."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G14/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FIn response, a Ministry of Housing,
OL,8,FCommunities and Local Government
OL,9,Fspokesperson said: "A permitted
OL,10,Fdevelopment right allows land to be
OL,11,Fused for campsites to support the
OL,12,Ftourism industry, which is of great
OL,13,Fvalue to this country's economy.
OL,15,F"The site owner must notify their
OL,16,Flocal authority before opening their
OL,17,Fcampsite, who then has a duty to check
OL,18,Fwhether the area is suitable for a
OL,19,Fcampsite. If not, they can remove the
OL,20,Fright and the landowner must submit a
OL,21,Fplanning application.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G15/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786623512
OL,3,CControversy over planning rules which
OL,4,Callow 'pop-up' campsites in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,F"If the owner opens a campsite, they
OL,8,Fare responsible for providing
OL,9,Ffacilities on site to dispose waste."
OL,11,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,12,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,13,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,14,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,15,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,16,Fbelow...
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G16/16
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
